services=[('01','Repairs & plumbing','From the little jobs that linger to the leaks that cannot wait.','Tap repairs and replacements; leaking pipes and radiators; radiator installation; toilet repairs and fitting; sink unblocking; washing machine and dishwasher connections.','plumbing'),('02','Kitchens & bathrooms','Plan the room. Fit it properly. Finish the details.','Kitchen and bathroom design and installation, from concept to completion. Full installations, partial refurbishments and practical improvements to existing rooms.','kitchens'),('03','Carpentry & fitting','Make the everyday parts of your home work better.','Door shaving and adjustments; laminate flooring; flat-pack furniture assembly; shelves, mirrors and other fittings.','carpentry'),('04','Electrical','Small electrical jobs through to larger installations.','Light-bulb replacement, household electrical work and full-house rewiring. Discuss the work and the appropriate electrician when arranging your quotation.','electrical'),('05','Painting & decorating','A fresh finish, with the preparation it needs.','Interior painting, wallpapering and decorating, alongside the repairs and fitting work that bring a room together.','decorating'),('06','CCTV & security','Keep an eye on your property when you are away.','Security systems and CCTV installation, including remote viewing from smart devices. Discuss the setup that suits your property.','security')]
